&lt;/h1>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="1-pgpool-ii-简介">&lt;span>1. Pgpool-II 简介&lt;/span>
 &lt;a href="#1-pgpool-ii-%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark">
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z">&lt;/path>&lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Pgpool-II 是一个位于PostgreSQL服务器和PostgreSQL数据库客户端之间的中间件，提供连接池、负载均衡、自动故障转移、复制等功能。作为关键的数据库中间件，对Pgpool-II进行有效的监控和日志分析对于保障PostgreSQL集群的稳定性至关重要。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Pgpool-II 监控方案</title><link>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/pgpool-ii-%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.kbsonlong.com/posts/pgpool-ii-%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88/</guid><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/">数据库</category><category domain="https://www.kbsonlong.com/categories/%E7%9B%91%E6%8E%A7/">监控</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="pgpool-ii-监控方案">&lt;span>Pgpool-II 监控方案&lt;/span>
